{title: Mutasir}
{artist: Javed Ali}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Is Kadar [A]Aapse Dil [B]Mutasir [E]Hua,        [E]Is Kadar [A]Aapse Dil [B]Mutasir [E]Hua
Aap [A]Ban [B]Gaye Ho [F#m]Hamaari [E]Dua,        Aap [A]Ban [B]Gaye Ho [F#m]Hamaari [E]Dua
Ab To [A]Har Saans [B]Lena,        [F#m]Sang [E]Aapke
Dil Ko [A]Bhaane [B]Lage Hai,        [F#m]Rang [E]Aapke
Aap [A]Hamse [G#m]Kabhi,        [F#m]Hona Na [E]Juda
Mere [E]Khuda [A]Mere [E]Khuda [B],        Hai Yeh [E]Dua [A]Mere [C#m]Khuda [E]
[E]Is Kadar [A]Aapse Dil [B]Mutasir [E]Hua,        [E]Chehra Haya Hai, Baate Saba Hai
[C#m]Ankhein Hain [F#m]Aaina,        [A]Ankhein Hain [E]Aaina
[E]Chehra Haya Hai, Baate Saba Hai,        [C#m]Ankhein Hain [F#m]Aaina
[A]Ankhein Hain [E]Aaina,        [E]Noor Se Aapke Maine Jana
[C#m]Kudrat Ka [F#m]Maayana,        [A]Kudrat Ka [E]Maayana
[A]Aapko [C#m]Paya To,        [F#m]Roshan Hua [E]Jahaan
Mere [E]Khuda [A]Mere [E]Khuda [B],        Hai Yeh [E]Dua [A]Mere [C#m]Khuda [E]
[E]Is Kadar [A]Aapse Dil [B]Mutasir [E]Hua,        [E] [A] [C#m] [E]
Mere [E] Khuda [A] Mere [E] Khuda [B]
Hai Yeh [E]Dua [A]Mere [C#m]Khuda [E],        [E]Dilkash Adaa Hai, Uff Bakhuda Hai
[C#m]Aisi Hai [F#m]Saadgi,        [A]Aisi Hai [E]Saadgi
[E] Dilkash Adaa Hai, Uff Bakhuda Hai
[C#m]Aisi Hai [F#m]Saadgi,        [A]Aisi Hai [E]Saadgi
[E]Aapse Saare Mere Nazaare,        [C#m]Ho Gayi [F#m]Aashiqui
[A]Ho Gayi [E]Aashiqui,        [A]Aapki [C#m]Adaayein Phir
[F#m]Dil Se Jaaye [E]Na,        Mere [E]Khuda [A]Mere [E]Khuda [B]
